From d9108bfdb746edacdb05bd27959a4ae63c6c7f3f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shivam Rawat <shivrawa@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Fri, 5 Jun 2026 01:38:17 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] drm/msm/a6xx: Fix stale rpmh votes after suspend

commit d9108bfdb746edacdb05bd27959a4ae63c6c7f3f upstream (v7.3-rc1).

There are stale RPMH votes (BCM votes) observed after GMU suspend. This
is because the rpmh stop sequences are skipped during gmu suspend. Fix
this and also move GMU to reset state to avoid any further activity.

Fixes: f248d5d5159a ("drm/msm/a6xx: Fix PDC sleep sequence")
Signed-off-by: Shivam Rawat <shivrawa@qti.qualcomm.com>
Signed-off-by: Akhil P Oommen <akhilpo@oss.qualcomm.com>
Tested-by: Neil Armstrong <neil.armstrong@linaro.org> # on SM8650-HDK
Reviewed-by: Dmitry Baryshkov <dmitry.baryshkov@oss.qualcomm.com>
Reviewed-by: Konrad Dybcio <konrad.dybcio@oss.qualcomm.com>
Patchwork: https://patchwork.freedesktop.org/patch/730652/
Message-ID: <20260605-assorted-fixes-june-v1-1-2caa04f7287c@oss.qualcomm.com>
Signed-off-by: Rob Clark <robin.clark@oss.qualcomm.com>

[ Backport to the v7.2-rc3 base of the Galaxy Tab S9 port.  The change is
  upstream's; only the hunks' line numbers differ, from the port's three
  patches to this file that come before it:
  msm-adreno-bound-fault-coredump-wait-gts9u.patch (through
  scripts/stage-gpu-recovery-experiment.sh),
  msm-adreno-a740-scm-init-param.patch and
  msm-adreno-gmu-hub-clk-param.patch.  Upstream's a6xx_gmu.c is the same
  in v7.2-rc3 and in this commit's parent.

  With the inverted test the GPU RSC's sleep sequence never ran once the
  GMU firmware had started, which it does at every GMU power-up, so the
  RSC kept its last votes; and GMU_STATUS_PDC_SLEEP was never set, so
  a6xx_rpmh_start() never ran the wake sequence either.  From this commit
  on both run at every GMU power cycle.

  scripts/build-mainline-kernel.sh applies this only with
  APPLY_SM8550_SLEEP_FIXES=1, after those three. ]
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/a6xx_gmu.c | 5 ++++-
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/a6xx_gmu.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/a6xx_gmu.c
index dd8a54072315..2e35932eae45 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/a6xx_gmu.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/a6xx_gmu.c
@@ -649,7 +649,7 @@ static void a6xx_rpmh_stop(struct a6xx_gmu *gmu)
 	int ret;
 	u32 val;
 
-	if (test_and_clear_bit(GMU_STATUS_FW_START, &gmu->status))
+	if (!test_and_clear_bit(GMU_STATUS_FW_START, &gmu->status))
 		return;
 
 	if (adreno_is_a840(adreno_gpu))
@@ -1488,6 +1488,9 @@ static void a6xx_gmu_shutdown(struct a6xx_gmu *gmu)
 	/* Stop the interrupts and mask the hardware */
 	a6xx_gmu_irq_disable(gmu);
 
+	/* Halt the gmu cm3 core */
+	gmu_write(gmu, REG_A6XX_GMU_CM3_SYSRESET, 1);
+
 	/* Tell RPMh to power off the GPU */
 	a6xx_rpmh_stop(gmu);
 
